        "checksum": "6093f95ac9d8ce1990973ce51cf54287f2bd54e99e841b5404ebea59771540c9_1_1_0_0__1",
        "ggIuU1C4ZiO_text": "<p><strong>1. Why does Amun Organics use grass-fed tallow in its products?</strong><br>Grass-fed tallow is an ancient, nutrient-dense ingredient rich in essential fatty acids, vitamins, and antioxidants that deeply nourish and repair both hair and skin. Unlike synthetic alternatives, tallow closely mimics our skin’s natural oils, making it highly bioavailable and effective in restoring moisture, strengthening hair strands, and promoting overall scalp health.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>2. Are Amun Organics products free from synthetic chemicals and fragrances?</strong><br>Yes! We are committed to purity and transparency. Our products contain no synthetic fragrances, parabens, sulfates, or artificial preservatives. Every ingredient is intentionally chosen to support your health and well-being, ensuring a truly clean and nourishing experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>3. Why do you use glass packaging instead of plastic?</strong><br>We choose glass because it preserves the purity and potency of our formulations without leaching harmful chemicals. Glass is also endlessly recyclable, making it a more sustainable choice for both your health and the environment. By choosing Amun Organics, you’re making an eco-conscious decision that supports a cleaner planet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>4. Are your products suitable for all hair types?</strong><br>Absolutely! Our formulations are designed to work in harmony with all hair types and textures. Whether you have straight, wavy, curly, or coily hair, our nutrient-rich blends provide hydration, strength, and balance without weighing your hair down.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>5. Where are Amun Organics products made?</strong><br>Our products are formulated in Aspen and handcrafted in Canada with the utmost care. We source the highest quality organic ingredients, ensuring that each bottle reflects our commitment to integrity, sustainability, and holistic wellness.</p>"
      }
